        We will also have no liability and you agree to assume all risk of loss that arises out of or relates to any loss or theft of your device or any information
        contained within any device.
    </p>

    <h2>11. Duty of Reasonable Care</h2>
    <p>
        We will exercise good faith and reasonable care in processing your transactions in accordance with these Terms and Conditions.
        You will similarly exercise good faith and reasonable care in:- (i) using the sites, (ii) observing and maintaining security procedures,
        (iii) communicating with us, and (iv) In reviewing your transaction records for any errors or discrepancies.
    </p>

    <h2>12. Cancellation and Refund</h2>
    <p>
        Once a payment has been successfully processed for our services, it cannot be cancelled, refunded, or reversed.
        All payments made are final and non-refundable.
    </p>

    <h2>13. Website</h2>
    <p>
        Emirates Taste Catering Services Food LLC maintains the
        <a href="https://www.emiratestaste.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.emiratestaste.com</a> Website.
    </p>

    <h2>14. Governing law</h2>
    <p>
        United Arab of Emirates is our country of domicile. The Laws of the United Arab Emirates shall govern the use of the Site and the Terms of Use,
        without regards to conflict of laws principals. All disputes arising in connection therewith shall be heard only by a court of competent jurisdiction in U.A.E.
    </p>

    <h2>15. Accepted payment methods</h2>
    <p>
        We accept payment by VISA or Mastercard debit and credit cards in AED for our service.
    </p>

    <h2>16. Sanctions compliance</h2>
    <p>
        We will not trade with or provide any services to OFAC and sanctioned countries.
    </p>

    <h2>17. Minors</h2>
    <p>
        Customer using the website who are Minor /under the age of 18 shall not register as a User of the website and shall not transact on or use the website.
    </p>
</article>

@if (User.Identity?.IsAuthenticated == true)
{
